  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">South Africa, Zambia, Zimbabwe. Students&#x2019; Rights, Academic Freedom and Equitable Higher Education:

Strengthening young civil society, especially focusing on marginalized groups such as women and LGBTI students, with capacity to demand academic freedom and equitable higher education. Documenting, reporting and sharing information about human rights violations against students and learners. Building networks for learning and exchange between young activists.</narrative>
  </description>
